<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_debug_apache">ActionDebugApache</link></para>

<para>This class handles the debugging of Apache configurations and settings. It retrieves various Apache debug information based on the provided arguments and displays the information in a message box or editor. </para>
